.bee/
.claude/
.secrets/
.wasp/

# Stray Go build artifacts (transient — regenerated on each `go run`).
# Most common: generator.exe from `go run testvectors/generator/main.go` on Windows.
*.exe
# Same thing on Linux/macOS has no extension: `go build ./...` drops a
# binary per main package, named after its directory, at the repo root.
/generator
/DALOS_Crypto

# DALOS wallet files — keystore/export.go writes filenames of shape
# {first7_pubkey}...{last7_pubkey}.txt to the working directory.
*...*.txt
